{
    "title": "Manticore - Black Ledger",
    "kind": "quest",
    "startsWhen": "quest(manticore_money) == 2",
    "variables": [
        {
            "name": "pieces",
            "value": "0"
        }
    ],
    "steps": [
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 4
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "MANTICORE",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Chapter 7 - Black Ledger",
                "zh": "第七章 - 黑色账本"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Three Nova couriers, all drifting at Rustbelt Salvage. Each one carries a piece of the ledger. Hack all three and I can stitch it together.",
                        "zh": "三艘新星信使船，都漂在锈带回收站附近。每艘都有一部分账本。三艘都破解了，我就能把它拼起来。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "And keep your eyes open. If Crane knows we have Marlowe, he knows we'll go for the wrecks.",
                        "zh": "眼睛放亮点。克莱恩要是知道马洛在我们这儿，就知道我们会去找那些残骸。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "ledger_briefed"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:rustbelt"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:rustbelt",
            "dock": false,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Fly to Rustbelt Salvage.",
                "zh": "飞往锈带回收站。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 8
        },
        {
            "type": "wreck",
            "race": "terran",
            "name": "Nova Courier A",
            "at": "-6000 0 30000"
        },
        {
            "type": "wreck",
            "race": "terran",
            "name": "Nova Courier B",
            "at": "0 3000 38000"
        },
        {
            "type": "wreck",
            "race": "terran",
            "name": "Nova Courier C",
            "at": "6000 -2000 30000"
        },
        {
            "type": "on",
            "trigger": "hacked",
            "steps": [
                {
                    "type": "set",
                    "variable": "pieces",
                    "value": "pieces + 1"
                },
                {
                    "type": "radio",
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Got a piece of the ledger. {pieces} of 3.",
                        "zh": "拿到一部分账本了。{pieces} / 3。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "objective",
            "station": "manticore_neox:rustbelt",
            "text": {
                "en": "Hack the three Nova couriers.",
                "zh": "破解三艘新星信使船。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "waituntil",
            "condition": "pieces >= 3"
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran Idris Kane",
            "text": {
                "en": "That ledger is Nova property. I'll take it back off your wreck.",
                "zh": "那本账本是新星的财产。我会从你的残骸上把它拿回来。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 5,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 2,
            "behaviour": "enemy",
            "name": "Kane Wingman"
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:rustbelt",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Idris Kane",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 28,
                    "count": 1,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Defeat Captain Kane.",
                "zh": "击败凯恩上尉。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "objective",
            "station": "manticore_neox:rustbelt",
            "text": {
                "en": "Finish off Kane's wingmen.",
                "zh": "消灭凯恩剩下的僚机。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "waituntil",
            "condition": "alive(Kane Wingman) == 0"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:rustbelt",
            "on": false
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran Idris Kane",
            "text": {
                "en": "Crane... will just... buy another captain...",
                "zh": "克莱恩……只会……再买一个上尉……"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "reward",
            "credits": 18000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Ledger recovered",
                "zh": "账本已找回"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "kane_down"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:manticore",
            "dock": true,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Bring the ledger to the Manticore.",
                "zh": "把账本带回蝎尾狮号。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "It's all here. Payments to Tengs, Sladek, Ulrus, D'Rak, Sh'Gaal. Every raid that drove the frontier stations to buy Nova protection.",
                        "zh": "全在这里了。付给滕格斯、斯拉德克、乌鲁斯、德拉克、希加尔的钱。每一次袭击都逼得边境空间站去买新星的保护。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Ines Marlowe",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "He paid the pirates to create the fear, then sold the cure. That's the whole business.",
                        "zh": "他花钱让海盗制造恐慌，然后再出售解药。这就是他全部的生意。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Then we put it in front of the whole sector. But Crane won't sit still. Expect him to hit back, and hard.",
                        "zh": "那我们就把它摆到全星区面前。但克莱恩不会坐以待毙。等着他狠狠反击吧。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "complete",
            "reward": 9000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Chapter 7 complete",
                "zh": "第七章 完成"
            }
        }
    ]
}
